From fd2d3a61e36bff90a1fcd88e208da9278e5e3e18 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Howard Hsu <howard-yh.hsu@mediatek.com>
Date: Mon, 30 May 2022 16:31:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/35] hostapd: mtk: Support EDCCA hostapd configuration

Add EDCCA configuration and control handlers, including BW160 support.
Validate all configuration and control-interface values, keep the
compensation attribute signed to match the mt76 ABI, and reject incomplete
vendor responses.
